{
  "annotations":{"list":[]},"editable":false,"schemaVersion":42,
  "title":"Trading Coin — Silver Pipeline Overview","uid":"coin-silver","timezone":"utc","refresh":"30s","time":{"from":"now-6h","to":"now"},
  "tags":["silver","market-data","trading-readiness"],
  "panels":[
    {"id":1,"type":"row","title":"Source & Trading Readiness","collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":24,"h":1},"panels":[]},
    {"id":2,"type":"text","title":"Silver 1m source contract","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":1,"w":8,"h":6},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"## Binance Spot + BingX Spot\n**Feed:** WebSocket  ·  **Base timeframe:** closed 1m candles\n\nSilver Parquet is the replay source. Higher timeframes are derived on demand. Readiness below means **data derivable**, not live execution enabled."}},
    {"id":3,"type":"stat","title":"Healthy sources","gridPos":{"x":8,"y":1,"w":4,"h":6},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(silver_symbol_health_status > bool 0)","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"suffix":" / 6","thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"red","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":5},{"color":"green","value":6}]}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":4,"type":"stat","title":"Last market candle","gridPos":{"x":12,"y":1,"w":4,"h":6},"targets":[{"expr":"max(silver_symbol_last_close_unixtime) * 1000","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"dateTimeAsIso","color":{"mode":"fixedColor","fixedColor":"blue"}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":5,"type":"stat","title":"Last Silver batch","gridPos":{"x":16,"y":1,"w":4,"h":6},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_last_success_unixtime * 1000","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"dateTimeAsIso","color":{"mode":"fixedColor","fixedColor":"blue"}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":6,"type":"stat","title":"Worst symbol lag","gridPos":{"x":20,"y":1,"w":4,"h":6},"targets":[{"expr":"max(silver_symbol_lag_seconds)","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"s","decimals":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":1800},{"color":"red","value":3900}]}},"overrides":[]}},

    {"id":10,"type":"row","title":"Silver Data Quality","collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":7,"w":24,"h":1},"panels":[]},
    {"id":11,"type":"stat","title":"Candles today","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(silver_symbol_rows{window=\"today\"})","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":12,"type":"stat","title":"Trailing candles not materialized","description":"Fully closed one-minute candles after the latest Silver candle. This is freshness, not an internal continuity gap.","gridPos":{"x":4,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(silver_symbol_trailing_candles)","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":120},{"color":"red","value":260}]}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":13,"type":"stat","title":"Internal gaps today","description":"Missing candles only inside the available history up to each symbol's latest candle.","gridPos":{"x":8,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(silver_symbol_missing_candles{window=\"today\"})","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":1},{"color":"red","value":5}]}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":14,"type":"stat","title":"Worst continuity today","description":"Completeness between midnight UTC and the latest available candle; freshness is shown separately.","gridPos":{"x":12,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"targets":[{"expr":"min(silver_symbol_completeness_ratio{window=\"today\"})","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"percentunit","decimals":2,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"red","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":0.98},{"color":"green","value":0.995}]}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":15,"type":"stat","title":"Rejected — last 24h","gridPos":{"x":16,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"targets":[{"expr":"increase(silver_records_rejected_total[24h])","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"red","value":1}]}},"overrides":[]}},
    {"id":16,"type":"stat","title":"Duplicates dropped — 24h","gridPos":{"x":20,"y":8,"w":4,"h":5},"description":"Deduplication is expected for repeated candle updates; this is not automatically an error.","targets":[{"expr":"increase(silver_duplicates_total[24h])","instant":true,"refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"color":{"mode":"fixedColor","fixedColor":"blue"}},"overrides":[]}},

    {"id":20,"type":"row","title":"Symbol Data Health","collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":13,"w":24,"h":1},"panels":[]},
    {"id":21,"type":"table","title":"Status by exchange / symbol","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":14,"w":8,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_health_status","instant":true,"format":"table","refId":"A"}],"transformations":[{"id":"organize","options":{"excludeByName":{"Time":true,"__name__":true,"job":true,"instance":true,"market":true},"renameByName":{"exchange":"Exchange","symbol":"Symbol","Value":"Status"}}}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Status"},"properties":[{"id":"mappings","value":[{"type":"value","options":{"0":{"text":"STALE / GAP","color":"red"},"1":{"text":"DELAYED","color":"yellow"},"2":{"text":"HEALTHY","color":"green"}}}]},{"id":"custom.cellOptions","value":{"type":"color-text"}}]}]}},
    {"id":22,"type":"bargauge","title":"Lag by symbol","gridPos":{"x":8,"y":14,"w":8,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_lag_seconds","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{exchange}} / {{symbol}}","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"s","min":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":1800},{"color":"red","value":3900}]}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"displayMode":"gradient","orientation":"horizontal","showUnfilled":false}},
    {"id":23,"type":"bargauge","title":"Internal gaps today by symbol","gridPos":{"x":16,"y":14,"w":8,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_missing_candles{window=\"today\"}","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{exchange}} / {{symbol}}","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"decimals":0,"min":0,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":1},{"color":"red","value":5}]}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"displayMode":"gradient","orientation":"horizontal","showUnfilled":false}},

    {"id":30,"type":"row","title":"Historical Coverage & Backfill","collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":22,"w":24,"h":1},"panels":[]},
    {"id":31,"type":"table","title":"Earliest Silver 1m by symbol","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":23,"w":8,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_earliest_candle_unixtime * 1000","instant":true,"format":"table","refId":"A"}],"transformations":[{"id":"organize","options":{"excludeByName":{"Time":true,"__name__":true,"job":true,"instance":true,"market":true},"renameByName":{"exchange":"Exchange","symbol":"Symbol","Value":"Earliest UTC"}}}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Earliest UTC"},"properties":[{"id":"unit","value":"dateTimeAsIso"}]}]}},
    {"id":32,"type":"table","title":"Latest Silver 1m by symbol","gridPos":{"x":8,"y":23,"w":8,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_latest_candle_unixtime * 1000","instant":true,"format":"table","refId":"A"}],"transformations":[{"id":"organize","options":{"excludeByName":{"Time":true,"__name__":true,"job":true,"instance":true,"market":true},"renameByName":{"exchange":"Exchange","symbol":"Symbol","Value":"Latest UTC"}}}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Latest UTC"},"properties":[{"id":"unit","value":"dateTimeAsIso"}]}]}},
    {"id":33,"type":"bargauge","title":"Historical completeness","gridPos":{"x":16,"y":23,"w":5,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"silver_symbol_completeness_ratio{window=\"coverage\"}","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{exchange}} / {{symbol}}","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"percentunit","min":0.95,"max":1,"decimals":3,"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"red","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":0.98},{"color":"green","value":0.995}]}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"displayMode":"gradient","orientation":"horizontal","showUnfilled":true}},
    {"id":34,"type":"text","title":"Backfill state","gridPos":{"x":21,"y":23,"w":3,"h":8},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"## NOT INSTRUMENTED\nNo authoritative persistent backfill job state exists yet. Coverage is measured directly from closed Silver Parquet; no status is fabricated."}},

    {"id":40,"type":"row","title":"Trading Data Readiness","collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"x":0,"y":31,"w":24,"h":1},"panels":[]},
    {"id":41,"type":"bargauge","title":"Timeframe readiness — healthy sources","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":32,"w":12,"h":8},"description":"1m is available; higher timeframes are derivable on demand. Count is out of 6 configured exchange/symbol sources.","targets":[{"expr":"sum by(timeframe,readiness) (silver_timeframe_ready{mode=\"on_demand\"})","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{timeframe}} — {{readiness}}","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"min":0,"max":6,"decimals":0,"suffix":" / 6","thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"red","value":null},{"color":"yellow","value":5},{"color":"green","value":6}]}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"displayMode":"gradient","orientation":"horizontal","showUnfilled":true}},
    {"id":42,"type":"text","title":"Strategy-layer boundary","gridPos":{"x":12,"y":32,"w":12,"h":8},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"### Current consumers\n- **Paper Trading:** PAPER ONLY\n- **Hybrid Adapter:** SHADOW ONLY\n- **Wyckoff Adapter:** SHADOW ONLY\n\nData readiness does not enable API keys or live execution. EMA/ATR/volume and Wyckoff features are computed by their consumers, not materialized in Silver."}},

